<title>MALAYSIA: Nam Fatt seeks continued suspension.</title>
<headline>Nam Fatt seeks continued suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nam Fatt Corp Bhd said it was seeking a continued suspension in its stock until September 18, with a requotation on September 19.</p>
<p>In a letter sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Saturday, the construction concern said the suspension was pending an announcement about an acquisition. It did not provide details.</p>
<p>Shares of the company last traded at 8.55 ringgit on September 12.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
